     2	
     3	Amounts are nonnegative safe integer cents. Quantities are positive safe integers. Catalog validates and snapshots products/promotions on construction and returns copies. Product SKU and promotion code keys are nonempty and unique by configuration. Matching is exact and case-sensitive. Products may cost zero. A promotion cap may be zero. All public inputs are structurally typed; malformed containers or nonboolean eligibility flags are outside the contract. Invalid quantities, unknown SKUs and unsafe monetary products/sums throw synchronously, including when a promotion is unknown or omitted. Do not silently clamp invalid amounts. Existing error text is public.
     4	
